# What never needs to cross into the build context.
#
# The image ships the app and its build; it does not ship the workspace's data,
# the screenshots and reports the gates leave behind, or the local dependencies.
# `data/` is a volume, so keeping it out also means a database change never
# invalidates the build cache.

node_modules
.next
out

data
fixtures

screenshots
coverage
test-results
playwright-report

**/*.md
!README.md

.env
.env.*

.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore

/tmp
.cache
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.log
